<https://w3id.org/spot#LineSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/spot#EntitySpace> .
<https://w3id.org/spot#LineSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A one-dimensional space that can be used to represent e.g., vertical height references such as water levels "@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot#LineSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Line Space"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/spot#PhysicalSpace
