<https://w3id.org/spot#PhysicalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Physical Space is the superclass for the global, asset and entity spaces,\r\n    which implies that these spaces are can be directly mapped in physical space, as opposite to virtual spaces.\r\n    It is an abstract class and should not be used directly."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot#PhysicalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Physical Space"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/spot#PointSpace
