<https://w3id.org/spot#VolumeSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Volume Space can represent three-dimensional resources, such as 3D models or point clouds."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot#VolumeSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Volume Space"@en .
